  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "📝 About Ward 5",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Ward No. 5 of Kathmandu Metropolitan City is centered around Hadigaun (Handigaun), one of the oldest continuously inhabited settlements in the Kathmandu Valley with roots tracing back to the Kirat and Licchavi periods. The ward encompasses historic neighborhoods including Hadigaun, Bhatbhateni, Bishalnagar and surrounding areas. It is renowned for its rich Newar cultural heritage, traditional festivals such as Kahi Nabhako Jatra (a unique chariot procession without wheels), ancient temples, traditional stone water spouts (hiti), public rest houses (falcha), and numerous community monuments. With a population of approximately 18,320, Ward 5 represents a living blend of deep historical legacy and modern urban life."
    },
    {
      "title": "🏛️ Cultural Significance",
      "type": "list",
      "content": [
        "One of the oldest settlements in Kathmandu Valley (Kirat–Licchavi origins)",
        "Home to Kailashkut Bhawan historical site (Licchavi era palace complex)",
        "Famous for Kahi Nabhako Jatra – unique wheel-less chariot festival",
        "Contains numerous traditional hiti (stone spouts), inar, falcha and public taps",
        "96+ monuments recognized by Department of Archaeology (predominantly community-scale)",
        "Important Newar cultural and residential core with traditional tole life"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "🗂️ Data Source",
      "type": "list",
      "content": [
        "Administrative Boundary: Kathmandu Metropolitan City / National Geoportal",
        "Road Network & Works: Ward Office / Field Survey",
        "Water & Sanitation: Ward Office / KUKL related mapping",
        "Jatra Routes: Community & Cultural Mapping",
        "Hiti, Inar, Falcha, Public Taps: Field Survey + Cultural Inventory",
        "Buildings & Landmarks: OSM + Field Verification",
        "Monuments: Department of Archaeology / Local Inventory"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "👥 Prepared By",
      "type": "list",
      "content": [
        "<a href='https://www.linkedin.com/in/kessikushal/' target='_blank'>Kushal K.C</a>"
      ]
    }
  ],
